WEBVTT

00:00.010 --> 00:01.410
<b>The same voice actor?</b>

00:04.510 --> 00:05.640
<b>I'm not sure.</b>

00:05.750 --> 00:08.340
<b>I like the way he talks.</b>

00:08.450 --> 00:10.320
<b>It's somewhat open?</b>

00:10.420 --> 00:12.850
<b>I think that's why
I like that episode.</b>

00:13.290 --> 00:18.450
<b>The old-man-like alien.
I like him.</b>

00:20.130 --> 00:23.890
<b>His words curl, don't they?</b>

00:24.170 --> 00:27.530
<b>Yeah, I like it. Moe.</b>

00:28.570 --> 00:33.410
<b>If I use that word here,
we'd have to explain it again.</b>

00:50.230 --> 00:56.160
<b>From here,
a couple surreal episodes appear...</b>

00:59.070 --> 01:00.690
<b>I think.</b>

01:19.960 --> 01:23.190
<b>Why does the shijimi cry out
''mi mi?''</b>

01:24.730 --> 01:27.850
<b>It's amazing how Gema knows
what happened immediately.</b>

01:27.960 --> 01:29.430
<b>I think so too.</b>

01:56.790 --> 01:59.780
<b>When did Usada's ears become-</b>

02:02.630 --> 02:05.620
<b>So versatile and useful?</b>

02:05.730 --> 02:07.930
<b>But they're a helicopter, after all.</b>

02:20.550 --> 02:24.750
<b>I guess his flower does change a lot.</b>

02:27.420 --> 02:32.720
<b>Maybe it's determined
by the key animator's feelings.</b>

02:40.740 --> 02:44.230
<b>This is another item that
Americans might not know about.</b>

02:44.340 --> 02:45.430
<b>On, no?</b>

02:46.910 --> 02:51.850
<b>Do they know massaging sticks?</b>

02:54.150 --> 02:55.780
<b>For your shoulders?</b>

02:55.880 --> 02:59.180
<b>Right.
It's hooked at the end.</b>

02:59.290 --> 03:02.280
<b>When you hook and press that
against your shoulder,</b>

03:03.020 --> 03:05.360
<b>it gives you a shiatsu massage.</b>

03:05.460 --> 03:07.490
<b>One of the animators
must really love it.</b>

03:07.600 --> 03:12.800
<b>I have one at home, but it's probably
not an American household item.</b>

03:12.900 --> 03:15.560
<b>Broccoli has a bunch lying around.</b>

03:15.670 --> 03:16.800
<b>Everyone has sore shoulders?</b>

03:16.910 --> 03:18.370
<b>Yes.</b>

03:21.610 --> 03:24.080
<b>Do they know oharai? Exorcist?</b>

03:24.180 --> 03:26.310
<b>That they know.</b>

03:26.850 --> 03:28.580
<b>That's cute.</b>
